        "review_scope": "Pages 1\u20134 practical filing standards; dated transitional guidance, not a determination of current controlling law.",
        "stated_effective_date": "2013-04-29",
        "stated_issuance_date": "2013-04-29",
        "summary": "Follow division procedures for proposed orders; the order describes erroneously filed proposed orders going to the pending queue. Separate cases require separate transactions and documents must be distinct items. Civil cover sheet and confidentiality notice are separate documents. Mail-service envelopes go to the serving court or clerk. The order states five days to correct nonconforming pending-queue submissions."
      },
