        "stated_effective_date": "2025-01-01",
        "stated_issuance_date": "2024-12-05",
        "summary": "Recognized counsel must file the initial pleading, obtain substitution or file an appearance. Coverage counsel files an appearance, subject to the same-firm exception where the firm signed the initial pleading or appearance. Civil limited-appearance termination must be filed. Sole nonsubstantive-continuance appearances have an exception. Withdrawal motions include reasons and the client\u2019s last-known address, phone and email."
      },
