        "summary": "Requests may be oral or written to the ADA coordinator, without case merits. The order lists 352-337-6237 and Room 410, 201 East University Avenue. Court-proceeding notices must include the prescribed accommodation statement in bold 14-point Times New Roman or Courier; it includes relay 711. Use the source for exact notice text."
